{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1414807-rebis-the-magnum-opus","id":1414807,"title":"Rebis the Magnum Opus","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-20T14:03:37-07:00","id":1414807,"title":"Rebis the Magnum Opus","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">So I know I have a lot of projects on the Back Burner already, and have been busy and still compiling them. But I had an Idea for the Alchemical themed splat I wanted to have in the CWOD. CWOD never had Prometheans and this shares a lot of concepts with them. In Fact Prometheans might work as antagonists or as Homuculi.<br /> <br /> But the basic jist is you play a Regis, and you are a new being the result of the merger two other humans. Your soul is like that of the Primordial Perfect Human, something akin to Adam Kadmon, that is both man and woman but also neither, and was larger with an awakened 3rd eye. You do not appear like this, this actually what your soul appears like. They would have a broad range of abilities from two past lives, but if their two lives overlaped in a ability these work like Supernal Abilities, so supernaturally excellent say Craft or Brawl or Science.<br /> <br /> They would have a two splat axis so a Vitriol Colour representing Nigredo/Albedo/Citrinitas/Rubedo and a Prima Materia representing a base matter symbolic of their origins/intent of their past lives merger.<br /> <br /> Besides Supernal Abilities they have Transmutations: Aspects of Alchemy tied to themes like Panacea for working potent medicines and healing or Solidus representing the state of solid matter, or Ignis representing the purifying crucible of flame.<br /> <br /> But still tossing ideas around in me noggin.<br /> <br /> Rebis: the Magnum Opus</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Refinement: is the power/enlightenment stat</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Azoth is the power units.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Vitriol: The different colors of Vitriol represent different types of Rebis.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Nigredo</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Albedo</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Citrinitas</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Rubedo</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prima Materia: the Rebis\u2019 metal</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Transmutations:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Viriditas</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Panacea</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Anima Mundi</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Pyros/Ignis</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Absorbent Earth/Bibulus Terrae</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Aqua Fortis</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Aether</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Metallum</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Calcination/Calor</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Solidus</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Liquidus</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Gaseous/Gasorum</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Plasma Stella</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Callus</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Oleum/Ducatus</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Et Partitus</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Cognitionus</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Lux</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Magnas Ridebam/fulgur/fulminis Iras</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Animalis Regnum</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Lignum</span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T14:17:34-07:00","id":1414810,"title":"","content":"That's cool, how are Rebisis made?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T14:28:11-07:00","id":1414816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1414807-rebis-the-magnum-opus?p=1414810#post1414810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's cool, how are Rebisis made?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm thinking some great ritual on the level of the Spell of Life for Mummies. Two Alchemists with appropriate levels of refinement work together complete a ritual which purifies, transmutes and merges their soul into a singular perfect soul. So I'm thinking the two Alchemists who merge might be Sorcerers, but I'm still open maybe they could just be philosophers/sages/ascetics and they are part of a group that could perform a group ritual rather then rely on an individual with singularly potent magic. Maybe even Mages could be involved in merging with another human, much like the Solificati Leader Halel.<br /> <br /> Still tossing around ideas. Maybe some Rebis are formed whole in the prime of their life. Or maybe all or just some are born of the fusion of two souls and bound into Prime Materia forming a Baby instead of a fullgrown person.<br /> <br /> Still tossing around ideas. I do figure these guys are very very rare.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"dat